# This project is built and run entirely inside Linux containers. Force LF on
# checkout so a clone made on Windows (where Git defaults to core.autocrlf=true)
# still works: a CRLF-terminated build_all.sh breaks `bash` inside the image and
# fails every `docker build`. See docker/README.md "Windows / Docker Desktop".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt-and-braces for the files that actually execute in the container.
*.sh        text eol=lf
*Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Never normalise binary blobs.
*.pth  binary
*.pt   binary
*.tar  binary
*.npy  binary
*.npz  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
